### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/2

### Add a new book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Rich Dad Poor Dad",
    "author": "Robert kiyosaki"
}

### Add a book with missing author (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Book Without Author"
}

### update a book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "title": "Wings of Fire (Updated Edition)"
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/3

### Delete a book that does not exist
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/99
